  "solution": "The given equation:**\n25 ÷ 12 × 5 − 36 + 24 = 72\n\nWe apply each option and solve the equation using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/8a6f93b0f8305d496162d41f65450f13e20c650df2dbe481929271174df469e9.png] \n\nOption 1) 36 and 25; × and + \n\n__**36 ÷ 12**__ + 5 − 25 × 24 = 72\n\n3 + 5 − __**25 **____**×**____** 24**__ = 72\n\n__**3 + 5**__ - 600 = 72\n\n__**8 - 600**__ = 72\n\n-592 ≠ 72\n\nOption 2) 24 and 5; + and −\n__**25 ÷ 12**__ × 24 + 36 - 5 = 72\n\n__**2.08 × 24**__ + 36 - 5 = 72\n\n__49.9 __**__**+**____** 36**__ - 5 = 72**\n__85.9 __**__**-**____** 5**__ = 72**\n80.9 ≠​ 72\n\nOption 3) 5 and 12; × and − \n__**25 ÷ 5**__ - 12 × 36 + 24 = 72\n\n5 - __**12 **____**×**____** 36**__ + 24 = 72\n\n5 - __432__**__** + 24**__ = 72**\n**__5 - 456__** = 72\n\n451 ≠​ 72\n\nOption 4) 5 and 12; + and − \n__**25 ÷ 5**__ × 12 + 36 - 24 = 72\n\n__**5 × 12**__ + 36 - 24 = 72\n\n__60 __**__**+**____** 36**__ - 24 = 72**\n__96 __**__**-**____** 24**__ = 72\n\n72 =​ 72\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 4)**\n\n38:T",
